{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_durin_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_durin_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"午休時間","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_durin_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f0dd8d313918a73a272a3b7d9e4cee5b549cc82f2c12cf66aef558c6a1b82bfa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"12:10 P.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島食堂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大嬸，請給我一份蘑菇套餐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多加莓果醬和豆泥，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......好燙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這不是杜林嘛，介意拼個座嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，你隨意~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝了，這個時間人還挺多，到處都坐滿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你就一個人？怎麼沒和巡林者老爺子，還有夜刀他們一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己先過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛訓練完，他們還在收拾，我們準備一會去吃烤肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？一會要烤肉，你還在這點蘑菇套餐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，就這麼一點點，我很快就吃完了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大口咀嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......等下，是我眼花了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"三句話前不是還有一整盤的嗎，怎麼這就只剩一半了？！你也太快了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，這算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地上的食物和我老家的還挺不一樣的，我也有在放慢速度好好品嘗啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過蘑菇不管怎麼做都好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，沒人不知道你喜歡菌類了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，你這樣偏食，真的不會營養不良？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才——不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，味道不錯，我吃完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊？？等等，什麼時候吃完的......所以說你吃得真的太快了吧，沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題沒問題，別擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還可以吃得更快......不過，上次和黑角比試速度才剛被醫療部抓到教訓過，這兩天還是收斂點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們平時都這麼娛樂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好還好，一般啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，吃了點東西就開始想睡了，老爺子他們好慢啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去拿點飲料提提神——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔，我記得之前買的水果飲料還有剩。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是回去休息室太遠了......呼......哈，有點睏了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對了，公共休息室這個時候應該會有咖啡吧？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼動靜，好吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那邊的那個人是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，如此美好的下午，偏偏有人不懂珍惜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"我感到有邪惡的力量在騷動......喂，大傢伙，控制你的力量，別——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"別、哎、等下，兄弟別真動手啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是誰啊！弄出這種大型機械還給它裝了這麼危險的重武器啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，怎麼會變成這樣！再這樣下去，邪惡的迷霧將會就此蔓延！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，事已至此，我也只好使出我被封印的手段......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，早該想到的，我手臂的顫抖就是這一刻的預兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，大傢伙，不要怨恨我，我將給予引導......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"嬌小的杜林族人無言地跳起，精準地一腳踹在紅髮瓦伊凡的小腿上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰暗算——呃，你是，A4行動組的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，從剛剛起就好——吵——啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是在幹什麼，唔唔，紅毛傻蜥蜴大戰裝甲人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"紅毛......啥啊！？別取這種一聽就缺乏格調必然是爛片的標題行不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不對，現在不是說這個的時候！快後退，站在我的背後，小心這股邪惡的能量——哎你別亂來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時候就要這樣......去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！隨意刺激沉睡的猛獸會遭致災難......等等，我說，別亂用源石技藝隨意攻擊，萬一觸發機械的反擊機制會很危險——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？這個大塊頭的動作變緩了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，打中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈啊，好睏......唔，小哥，接下來該你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快把這個大傢伙機械臂下面的蓋子打開，主控制箱大概就在那裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎，哦，哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會操作那個嗎？要不然，嗯......我覺得直接轟掉那裡也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快快。別發呆，就是我剛剛打中的那個位置~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再愣著一會又要吃炮彈囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"你別推我......嘖，知道了，我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這份天賜的力量本不該在人前被展露，今天就破例讓你見識一下！......處理那種帶著機油味的東西可是我的專長，別小看我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"這個有點格調但還太粗糙了的大傢伙！給我乖乖停下來吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，其實我剛剛就想問了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說這種台詞的時候啊，真的不會害羞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......總算搞定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是哪裡的狂妄之徒，造出這麼個危險的機械裝甲也就算了，還給它裝備了武器，哈，幸好遇到的正好是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔，我看看。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哦......！這個拼裝，果然和以前附近的小孩子們自己做著玩的很像......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這樣的話，只要把這個蓋子打開，然後這樣......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"真是天真，武器可不是能這麼簡單拿出來顯擺的東西，所謂格調......唔哦哦哦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著！！別隨便亂動上面的線路，太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個不拔掉，一會大傢伙又得動起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這樣繞一下，再把這個切掉......好，這樣應該就沒問題了。大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"實在太亂來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，聽好了，不想被電流貫穿靈魂的話，在我檢查完之前就維持這個動作千萬別動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有洩漏就糟了，唔，這部分的損壞都是表層的，應該沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"這個痕跡，嗯，是剛才我的攻擊造成的，沒有影響主機板塊，風險並不大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，這裡的線路有點意思，還有這個能源裝置的內置手法，雖然粗糙，但很有想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？行動模組有受到干擾的痕跡，是源石技藝造成的影響？還有這部分負責供能的接線也被截斷了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好——了沒啊。我手都酸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且好......好睏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然大傢伙的行動被一時停止了，但最危險的幾個點完全沒有損壞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這傢伙，剛剛的那些，難道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"難道這一切都在你的計算之中嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼，是說這個控制線嗎？我不是都說了沒問題嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要多信任特地來幫忙的前輩一點啊，新人小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我是不像很多族人那樣那麼擅長機械，也拿不動錘子，做不出這種鐵皮大個子，但不會造不代表不會對付......這個還算簡單啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"先不說你的族人是什麼情況，這個在你看來......很簡單？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——原理很簡單啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，紅毛同學，一臉懷疑的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"是懾砂！不是紅毛！至少記住別人的代號吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想啊，那......懾砂你有看過小桃的蘋果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的是工程部之前借來研究的那個魔導器？那可不是普通蘋果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，在我們那裡就很普通啊。店裡就有賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"你老家到底是什麼樣的地方啊！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎——只是很普通的地下城啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"地下的杜林一族......嘶，我似乎在哪裡聽人提起過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不奇怪，來地上玩的族人好像還挺多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說啊——地上雖然也很好，又亮又寬敞，不少東西都很有意思，但大部分機械都還是太粗糙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管怎麼說，原來羅德島竟有你這樣明明掌握著力量，卻甘於隱於人群之中的人物......哼，是我小看你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不必多說，不必解釋，我都懂。關於你的事情，我不會多追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"像我們這樣的人，終究要背負這種宿命......是這麼說的來著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個紅毛大個子，看起來不大聰明。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（也無所謂啦......呼哈......好睏......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（差不多快要不行了，運動了一下，再不睡的話......明天可能會爬不起來......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是像你說的這麼了不起，也不至於......呼啊......成天被我家人唸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身體不好，總是在睡......哎呀，也不是我想這樣的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來你也有不為人知的過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看在我們剛剛並肩激戰的情分上，要讓我聽你傾訴也不是不可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你別閉著眼睛走路，會摔倒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才不會摔倒，好睏......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼......好說的，就是在家裡被唸得太多，還是溜出來清淨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這是......呼啊......天生的，治不好我也沒辦法啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ZZZzzzzz"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，話說到一半別站著就睡著啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸懶腰）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼啊......我又睡著了？唔，哪來的毛毯，好暖和。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那個紅毛大個子......是叫什麼砂來著......已經走了啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭有點痛，現在什麼時候了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時候可不早了，杜林啊，這次睡得有點久哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......巡林者老爺子，是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花了點力氣，忍不住就睡著了，我也沒有辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺子，我身上的毯子是你給我披的嗎？多謝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這可不是老夫的功勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫來找你的時候，你就已經在這裡這麼睡著了，啊呀，睡得可真香，讓人看著都想要一起睡覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——啊。我的睡眠品質老爺子羡慕不來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，確實如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那個叫懾砂的小夥子一直就坐在這邊上守著，說是欠你一個人情，嚯嚯，真是不錯的年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦......他居然沒直接走掉啊？艦船內部倒也不至於要這麼緊張啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，嗯，羅德島還是好心人多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不錯，不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不過杜林，聽到那個小夥子說你幫了他的忙，老夫還是挺吃驚的，怎麼不喊其他人來處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小事情啦。順手幫幫新人而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫可不記得你有這麼熱心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那種機械我比較熟嘛。難得在地上看到這種大傢伙......稍微有點懷念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒是，在這方面我們都比不過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說這個了！唔，這條毯子......下次遇到那個紅毛大個子，再還給他好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了......老爺子，烤肉呢？你們該不會不等我就吃完了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫可不會做這種招人嫌的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角正烤著呢，給你留了不少，你醒的正是時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好——耶——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，慢著點，小心摔了，難得看到杜林你跑這麼快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為睡得很暖和，我現在精神超級好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫有的時候看你這麼睡著，多少還是有點擔心，老夫相信，其他人應該也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老——爺——子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓。噓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好著呢，只是睡得多了點......這有什麼關係嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部的檢查我也定期會去，平時的任務我不也完全沒問題嘛，我們杜林族人可沒有那麼脆弱唷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且啊，只要說是因為身體原因，就完全沒人會怪我工作時間偷懶了，怎麼想都是賺了耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，搞不好多吃點肉，我還能變得比現在更有力氣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那你今天可得多吃點，多養點力氣。走吧，黑角他們還等著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林","speakerId":"AVG_char_501_Durin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶，烤肉——我來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"缺乏精神，虛弱無力，容易生病，稍有消耗就必須透過睡眠補足——這樣脆弱的身體，杜林早已習慣。\n天生的欠缺與疾病不同，無法使用藥物簡單地治癒。\n曾經也對此有所不滿甚至憤懣，但來到地上，見了許多大地上的故事的杜林，已選擇與自己體質上的虛弱和解。\n哎呀。\n身體虛弱一點，又有什麼關係呢？\n能在不那麼緊急的工作時間，不被打擾地在陽光下安靜地睡一會，這可真是太舒服啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_379_sesa","aliases":["懾砂"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
